      players: 'One player only. La Belle Lucie is a patience (solitaire) game played by a single player, who moves cards from the tableau fans to the four foundations. There are no partners or opponents.',
      deck: 'Standard 52-card deck.',
      equipment: 'Table space for 18 fan piles and four foundation piles.',
      dealing: 'Deal all 52 cards face-up into 17 fans of three cards each and one single card as the 18th fan. When redealing, reshuffle and redeal in the same pattern (fans of three with remainder as last fan).',
    },
    turnFlow: '1. **Foundations**: Build up by suit (A, 2, 3... K).\n2. **Tableau**: Only the top card of a fan is playable to another fan or a foundation.\n3. **Building**: On the tableau, build cards DOWN by suit (e.g., 9 of Hearts on 10 of Hearts). Moving sequences is NOT allowed.\n4. **Empty Spaces**: Once a fan is cleared, that space cannot be refilled.',
